      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.37.4",
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Three steps\n\nEXAMPLE is the reference photo. STEP 1 reads its pose and the scene around it, then generates a new 512 by 640 picture of the LoRA identity. Six steps, denoise 1. The reference pixels are not pasted in.\n\nSTEP 2 scales that picture to 1280 by 1600. FACE RIG then poses the head. Drag the handles on FACE RIG.\n\nSTEP 3 runs the face detailer, the eye detailer, and film grain. OPTIONAL UPSCALE is bypassed, so the save stays 1280 by 1600. Turn that node on and set the scale to 1.5, 2, or 4."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Three steps\n\nEXAMPLE is the reference photo. STEP 1 reads its pose and the scene around it, then generates a new 512 by 640 picture of the LoRA identity. Six steps, denoise 1. The reference pixels are not pasted in.\n\nSTEP 2 scales that picture to 1280 by 1600. FACE RIG then poses the head. Drag the handles on FACE RIG.\n\nSTEP 3 runs the face detailer, the eye detailer, and film grain. OPTIONAL UPSCALE is bypassed, so the save stays 1280 by 1600. Turn that node on and set the scale to 1.5, 2, or 4."
      },
      "title": "READ ME"
    },
