          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Analyze the reference image for a new picture that should feel like the same moment.\n\nDescribe the pose with camera-relative precision:\n- overall body orientation\n- torso, shoulder and hip rotation\n- each visible arm, hand and leg\n- head rotation, face orientation, and eye direction\nDo not flatten a small turn into \"facing the camera\". Say when the torso, head and eyes point different ways.\n\nThen describe the story of the picture:\n- where this is\n- the light\n- what the person is doing\n- clothing and anything they are holding, only as it is visible\n\nDo not mention gender, age, ethnicity, attractiveness or identity.\nDo not describe the person's face as a portrait of a specific individual.\nWrite one concise image-generation description.",
        600,
        "off",
        false,
        true,
        "auto"
      ]
    },
